    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DOMINO: I think that’s enough. Nice job but no more scrambling for me... Do you want me to beat you in Tic-tac-toe, or would you like to mingle some…\nLOLA: You are not going to beat me.\nDOMINO: I think I’m gonna beat you.",
      "DOMINO: Wait uh oh is this is our song? ... We shouldn’t go dance should we?\nLOLA: We definitely should not do that.\nDOMINO: What if you put your headphones on and danced with me?\nLOLA: That would be totally embarrassing. Nobody is dancing with their mother or with headphones on.",
      "DOMINO: That was some of the best twirling I’ve ever seen!\nLOLA: I think I will go sit back down.\nDOMINO: You sure?\nLOLA: I do not know how to “crank that”.",
      "LOLA: A bit too much, yes. I like here.\nDOMINO: Are you still grooving?",
      "LOLA: I do not think she is.\nDOMINO: I just needed to get this night out of my system. Come inside while you call a ride. I’ll venmo you for it."
    ]
